Java Practice Five,JDBC - Reading a `ResultSet`,"Iterate through a `ResultSet` from a query and print the values from each row."
Java Practice Five,JDBC - Transaction Management,"Demonstrate transaction management by using `setAutoCommit(false)`, `commit()`, and `rollback()`."
