The Math Class Methods,Absolute Value of MIN_VALUE,"What is the result of `Math.abs(Integer.MIN_VALUE)`? Explain why."
The Math Class Methods,Angle Normalization,"Use `Math.atan2(Math.sin(angle), Math.cos(angle))` to normalize any angle to the range -PI to PI."
