The Math Class Methods,Application of PI - Circle Circumference,"Calculate the circumference of a circle with a given radius using `Math.PI`."
The Math Class Methods,Application of abs() - Difference Between Numbers,"Find the absolute difference between two numbers, regardless of which is larger."
The Math Class Methods,Application of ceil() - Shipping Costs,"Use `Math.ceil()` to calculate the number of shipping boxes needed if each box holds 10 items and you have 33 items."
