The Math Class Methods,Application of hypot() - Vector Magnitude,"Calculate the magnitude of a 2D vector (x, y) using `Math.hypot(x, y)`."
The Math Class Methods,Application of log() - Compound Interest,"Use `Math.log()` to solve for time (t) in the continuous compound interest formula A = Pe^(rt)."
The Math Class Methods,Application of log10() - pH to H+ Concentration,"Calculate the H+ ion concentration from a given pH value using `Math.pow(10, -pH)`."
The Math Class Methods,Application of max() - Find Largest in Array,"Write a loop using `Math.max()` to find the largest number in an array of integers."
The Math Class Methods,Application of min() - Find Smallest in Array,"Write a loop using `Math.min()` to find the smallest number in an array of doubles."
The Math Class Methods,Application of pow() - Volume of a Sphere,"Calculate the volume of a sphere (4/3 * pi * r^3) using `Math.pow()` and `Math.PI`."
The Math Class Methods,Application of random() - Dice Roll,"Use `Math.random()` to simulate a six-sided die roll (generating an integer from 1 to 6)."
The Math Class Methods,Application of random() - Range Generation,"Write a method that uses `Math.random()` to generate a random integer within a given min/max range."
The Math Class Methods,Application of round() - Currency Calculation,"Round a double representing a monetary value (e.g., 45.678) to the nearest cent using `Math.round()`."
The Math Class Methods,Application of sqrt() - Distance Formula,"Implement the distance formula between two points (x1, y1) and (x2, y2) using `Math.sqrt()` and `Math.pow()`."
The Math Class Methods,Application of toDegrees() - User Output,"After a calculation results in an angle in radians, use `Math.toDegrees()` to show the result to the user in a more readable format."
