The Math Class,Monte Carlo Pi (Single Point),"Generate one random point (x, y) between 0 and 1 and check if it falls within a circle of radius 1."
The Math Class,Natural Logarithm,"Write a program that calculates the natural logarithm (base e) of a number using `Math.log()`."
The Math Class,Next Floating-Point Value,"Given a double, find the next floating-point number in the direction of positive infinity using `Math.nextUp()`."
The Math Class,Pick a Random Number from 1 to 10,"Generate a random integer between 1 and 10 (inclusive)."
The Math Class,Power of a Number,"Develop a program that computes `x` raised to the power of `y` (x^y), where `x` and `y` are inputs, using `Math.pow()`."
The Math Class,Probability Simulation (25% Chance),"Write a program that simulates an event with a 25% chance of success, printing 'Success' or 'Failure'."
