The Math Class,Random Angle in Radians,"Generate a random double between 0.0 and 2 * Math.PI to represent an angle in radians."
The Math Class,Random Brightness Level,"Generate a random double between 0.0 and 1.0 to represent a brightness or opacity level."
The Math Class,Random Card Suit,"Generate a random integer from 1 to 4 to represent a card suit (Clubs, Diamonds, Hearts, Spades)."
The Math Class,Random Card Value (2-10),"Generate a random integer from 2 to 10 to represent a numbered playing card."
The Math Class,Random Character from a String,"Given a string, use `Math.random()` to generate an index and print the character at that position."
The Math Class,Random Choice from Three Options,"Simulate a choice between three options (A, B, C) by generating a random number."
The Math Class,Random Day of the Month,"Generate a random integer between 1 and 31 to represent a day of the month."
