The Math Class,Roll a Six-Sided Die,"Use `Math.random()` to generate a random integer between 1 and 6 (inclusive) to simulate a die roll."
The Math Class,Round a Number,"Create a program that rounds a floating-point number to the nearest whole number using `Math.round()`."
The Math Class,Rounding to Two Decimal Places,"Write a program that takes a double and rounds it to two decimal places. This requires combining multiplication, `Math.round()`, and division."
The Math Class,Scaling the Output,"Generate a random double, multiply it by 1000, and print the result to demonstrate scaling."
