The System Class Methods,`console` object non-existence,"Write a program that behaves differently depending on whether `System.console()` returns a valid object or `null`."
The System Class Methods,`currentTimeMillis` and date formatting,"Pass the result of `System.currentTimeMillis()` to a `java.util.Date` constructor and format it into a readable string."
The System Class Methods,`currentTimeMillis` as a random seed,"Use `System.currentTimeMillis()` as a seed for a `java.util.Random` object."
The System Class Methods,`currentTimeMillis` for logging,"Create a simple logging method that prepends a timestamp from `System.currentTimeMillis()` to each message."
The System Class Methods,`currentTimeMillis` vs `nanoTime`,"Create a program that prints both values. Explain in comments when you would use one over the other."
