The System Class Methods,`exit` vs. `return`,"Create a `main` method and a helper method. Show how `return` from `main` ends the program, and contrast it with `System.exit()` from the helper method."
The System Class Methods,`exit` with security manager,"(Conceptual) If a `SecurityManager` is active, what checks does it perform before allowing `System.exit()` to proceed?"
The System Class Methods,`gc` and `finalize`,"Create an object with a `finalize()` method that prints a message. Call `System.gc()` and observe if and when the message is printed."
