Fact Questions,"'fail-fast' Iterator","What does it mean for an iterator from the Java Collections Framework to be 'fail-fast'?"
Fact Questions,"'final' Class","What does the 'final' keyword signify when applied to a class?"
Fact Questions,"'final' Variable","What does the 'final' keyword signify when applied to a variable?"
Fact Questions,"'final' vs. 'finally' vs. 'finalize'","Briefly state the distinct purpose of the keywords `final`, `finally`, and the method `finalize()`."
