Fact Questions,"'notify()' vs. 'notifyAll()'","In thread communication, what is the difference between `notify()` and `notifyAll()`?"
Fact Questions,"'static' Method","What does the 'static' keyword signify when applied to a method?"
Fact Questions,"'strictfp' Keyword","What does the 'strictfp' keyword enforce in floating-point calculations?"
Fact Questions,"'super' Keyword","Explain the purpose of the 'super' keyword."
Fact Questions,"'synchronized' Keyword","What is the difference between synchronizing a static method and synchronizing a non-static method?"
Fact Questions,"'this' Keyword","What is the purpose of the 'this' keyword?"
Fact Questions,"'throw' vs. 'throws'","What is the difference between the 'throw' and 'throws' keywords?"
Fact Questions,"'transient' Variable","What is a 'transient' variable in the context of object serialization?"
