Fact Questions,"Annotation Processor","What is an annotation processor and when does it run?"
Fact Questions,"Annotation Retention Policies","What are the three retention policies for annotations, and what do they signify?"
Fact Questions,"Anonymous Inner Class","What is an anonymous inner class and what is its main limitation regarding constructors?"
Fact Questions,"Application ClassLoader","Which class loader is typically responsible for loading classes from the application's classpath?"
Fact Questions,"Argument Passing","How are arguments passed in Java: by value or by reference?"
Fact Questions,"Array `hashCode()`","What is the result of calling `.hashCode()` on a Java array?"
Fact Questions,"ArrayList vs. LinkedList","Compare the underlying data structures of an ArrayList and a LinkedList."
Fact Questions,"Atomic Variables","What benefit do classes like `AtomicInteger` from `java.util.concurrent.atomic` provide?"
