Fact Questions,"BigInteger & BigDecimal","For what types of calculations are the `BigInteger` and `BigDecimal` classes necessary?"
Fact Questions,"Bitwise Shift Operators","What is the functional difference between the right-shift operator '>>' and the unsigned right-shift operator '>>>'?"
Fact Questions,"Bootstrap ClassLoader","Which class loader is responsible for loading core Java API classes like `java.lang.Object`?"
Fact Questions,"Bounded Wildcards","What is the difference between an upper-bounded wildcard (`? extends Type`) and a lower-bounded wildcard (`? super Type`)?"
